WEBVTT

00:13:28.701 --> 00:13:31.226
Workplaces that, like Vivek
with his photo-sharing,

00:13:31.250 --> 00:13:34.636
have created the conditions to help people
connect more meaningfully.

00:13:34.660 --> 00:13:39.176
DB: A number of employers have introduced
what they call "chatty tables."

00:13:39.200 --> 00:13:44.022
So it means that if you sit at that table,
expect to be spoken to.

00:13:44.046 --> 00:13:46.898
AG: I have to say, I love
the idea of a chatty table.

00:13:46.922 --> 00:13:49.536
It might be the most British
thing I've ever heard.

00:13:49.560 --> 00:13:52.276
DB: Well, we have one
thing even more British,

00:13:52.300 --> 00:13:54.376
which is the "friendly bench."

00:13:54.400 --> 00:13:56.458
AG: Oh, I've heard
about that! Tell me more.

00:13:56.482 --> 00:13:58.893
DB: So the friendly bench
you would find in a park,

00:13:58.917 --> 00:14:01.526
and it's an outdoor version
of a chatty table.